{
  "id": "MRK.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 5",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bashika hakurya y’ikiyaga c’i Galilaya, mu ntara ya Gerasene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu avuye mu bwato, umuntu arimwo impwemu mbi aza guhura na we avuye mu mva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muntu yaba mw’itongo ry’abapfuye kandi nta muntu yashobora kumuboha, naho yokoresheje iminyororo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko kenshi bamubohesha iminyororo ku maboko n’ivyuma ku maguru, ariko iyo minyororo yarayicagagura, n’ivyo vyuma akabivunagura. Nta muntu n’umwe yashobora kumutururuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko bukeye, uko bwije, yagendagenda mu mva no ku misozi aboroga kandi yikomeretsa n’amabuye akarishe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muntu abonye Yesu akiri kure, ariruka apfukama imbere yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arasemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Mbega undonderako iki ga Yesu, Mwana w’Imana Musumbavyose? Ndakwinginze mw’izina ry’Imana ntunkubagure!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo yabivuze kuko Yesu yari ahejeje kuyibwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu arayibaza ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yo iramwishura iti: “Nitwa Gitero, kuko turi benshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko za mpwemu mbi zinginga Yesu zishimitse ngo ntazirukane muri iyo ntara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hafi y’aho, hari umukuku w’ingurube zari ziragiwe ku musozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo badayimoni binginga Yesu bati: “Twemerere uturungike muri ziriya ngurube, tuzinjiremwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yesu arazemerera. Izo mpwemu mbi ziva muri wa muntu zinjira muri za ngurube. Izo ngurube zashika nk’ibihumbi bibiri. Nuko ziva kuri wa musozi ziruka zimanuka zisuka mu kiyaga ziradwibira, zicwa n’amazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abari baziragiye baca barahunga, baja kubivuga mu gisagara co hafi y’aho no mu misozi ihegereye. Nuko abantu barakorana baza kuraba ivyabaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitse aho Yesu ari, babona wa muntu yari yaraboshwe n’abadayimoni benshi yicaye, yambaye kandi afise ubwenge bukwiye, maze bagira ubwoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababonye uko vyagenze baca babiganira ivyabaye kuri wa muntu yari aboshwe n’abadayimoni no kuri za ngurube. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abo bantu binginga Yesu ngo abavire mu ntara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ariko arurira mu bwato, wa muntu yari yaraboshwe n’abadayimoni aramwinginga ngo bajane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yesu ntiyamwemerera, ahubwo amubwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa muntu aca arataha ageze i Dekapolisi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Akarere kagizwe n’ibisagara cumi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", atangura kuvuga ivyo Yesu yamukoreye. Abantu bose bavyumvise baratangara cane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amaze kujabuka agasubira hakurya y’ikiyaga, abantu isinzi baraza bakoranira hafi y’ikiyaga aho yari ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze haza umwe mu bakuru b’isinagogi, yitwa Yayiro. Abonye Yesu, apfukama imbere yiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aramutakambira ati: “Umukobwa wanje ari ku mpfiro. Ndakwinginze uze umurambikeko ibiganza akire abe muzima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yesu ajana na we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hari abantu benshi bari bamukurikiye, bamubanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri bo harimwo n’umugore yari amaze imyaka cumi n’ibiri agwaye ingwara yo mu gitereko yo kuva amaraso",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yava amaraso mu gihimba ciwe c’irondoka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yari yarivuje ku baganga benshi kandi atanga ivyo yari afise vyose, ariko aho gukira abandanya aremba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yumvise inkuru za Yesu, araza amuturuka inyuma, aca muri rya sinzi ry’abantu, akora ku mpuzu yiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko yibwira ati: “Naho nokora ku mpuzu yiwe gusa, nokira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo nyene kwa kuva amaraso kurahagarara, yumva mu mubiri wiwe ko akize ingwara yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako kanya nyene Yesu yumva ko hari ubushobozi bumuvuyemwo. Ahindukirira rya sinzi ry’abantu, arababaza ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigishwa biwe baramwishura bati: “Abantu bariko barakubanda impande zose, none uriko ubaza ngo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "  ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yesu abandanya araba hirya no hino kugira ngo arabe ko yobona uwamukozeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa mugore, kuko yari azi ivyamubayeko, aza ajugumira kubera ubwoba, apfukama imbere y’ibirenge vya Yesu, amubwira ukuri kwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aramubwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akiriko aravuga, haza abantu bavuye kwa Yayiro, wa mukuru w’isinagogi, bamubwira bati: “Umukobwa wawe yamaze gucikana. Ni kuki ubandanya ugora umwigisha?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yumvise ivyo bavuze, aca abwira Yayiro ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntiyemerera umuntu n’umwe kumukurikira kiretse Petero, Yakobo na Yohana mwene nyina wa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitse i muhira kwa wa mukuru w’isinagogi, Yesu ahasanga urwamo rwinshi, abantu barira, abandi na bo bakoma induru n’ijwi rirenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko arinjira, ababwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba bantu baramutwenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaze kubasohora bose, yinjirana na se na nyina b’umwana hamwe na ba bigishwa bari kumwe na we, baja aho umwana ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amufata ukuboko amubwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bisigura ngo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako kanya wa mukobwa arahaguruka atangura kugendagenda; yari afise nk’imyaka cumi n’ibiri. Babonye ibibaye, bose baratangara cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yesu arabihanikiriza ngo ntihagire umuntu n’umwe babwira ivyabaye, yongera ababwira ngo bagaburire uwo mwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
